    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROWING EPISODIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ever-expanding star map will add new gameplay types, levels and other seasonal content all in the same game. Episode 1: The Can will introduce PVP multiplayer modes. Future chapters will introduce monster hunts, smuggling runs, heists, hits and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/extras/fcf65e0e831e1c6e14c5dbe8df4e2d08.poster.avif?t=1750265141\" width=738 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/extras/fcf65e0e831e1c6e14c5dbe8df4e2d08.webm?t=1750265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/extras/fcf65e0e831e1c6e14c5dbe8df4e2d08.mp4?t=1750265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASSIVELY MODULAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Cards can change the game as easily as playing a card. Build new games to fit your play style from a large collection of cards to change movement, game rules, weapon effects, gravity, visual effects, levels and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RPG MEETS ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different character races, classes, weapon affinities and magic abilities as you explore and forge your own in the Vital Systems Gameverse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBRACE THE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With modular levels, modular rules, character magic, and a huge arsenal of weapons\u2026 you may never play the same game in the same way twice. Realism is overrated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/extras/5c660ebf499c8ac12fb85f97fb49c468.poster.avif?t=1750265141\" width=738 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/extras/5c660ebf499c8ac12fb85f97fb49c468.webm?t=1750265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445410/extras/5c660ebf499c8ac12fb85f97fb49c468.mp4?t=1750265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
